OL,3,GNEWSAJailed undertaker in bid to appeal
OL,4,Aagainst sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictims of the Legacy funeral scandal
OL,7,Fsay it is an "insult" Hull undertaker
OL,8,FRobert Bush has lodged an application
OL,9,Fto appeal against his 20-year prison
OL,10,Fsentence.
OL,12,FBush, 48, admitted keeping 30 bodies
OL,13,Fafter their funerals, presenting
OL,14,Ffamilies with the ashes of strangers
OL,15,Fand selling fake funeral plans.
OL,17,FHe pleaded guilty to 67 separate
OL,18,Foffences and was sentenced in July
OL,19,F2026.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
